  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NCC-PRAIRIES 2015-2 PHJV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project involves securing, enhancing and managing critical wetland ecosystems and associated habitat within the Prairie and Aspen Parkland ecoregions of Alberta, Saskatchewan, and Manitoba. Breeding waterfowl habitat will be protected through land purchases (fee simple acquisition) and perpetual conservation easements. Specifically, NCC will secure via fee..simple acquisition 826 acres (182 wetland, 644 upland), 413 acres in conservation easements (91 wetland and 322 upland), enhance 210 upland..acres, and manage 78,560 acres (17,283 wetland, 61,277 upland).</narrative>
  </description>
